{"articleNo":"126778","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=126778&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"학사제도 개선(변경) 알림[전과, 졸업유예, 조기졸업]","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.03.27","hit":"7055","attachments":[{"name":"학사제도 개선(안).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=126778&attachNo=4169"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent\" color=\"#666666\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong>학사제도 관련&nbsp;개선 예정인 사항을 다음과 같이 알려드리오니 참고하시기 바랍니다.</strong></span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"+0\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #6b9900\"><font color=\"#f6f6f6\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">※&nbsp;이 사항은 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">규정심의위원회 등을 거쳐 확정할 예정이며,&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">심의과정에서 변경될 수 있음을 알려드립니다.</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></font></font></font></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#212121\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1.&nbsp;확정예정 시기 : 2015년 5월</span></span></font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#212121\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. 주요 변경내용</span></span></font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#212121\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></font></span></span><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#212121\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">가. 교육여건 등을 고려하여 학과에서 전과 허가 인원 및 심사기준을 정할 수 있도록 명시</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; COLOR: #933030; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><font color=\"#212121\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;나. 전과&nbsp;신청서 </span></span>제출 시 해당 학과 경유 </span></span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; COLOR: #933030; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><font color=\"#212121\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;다. 졸업유예자는 최소 1과목 이상 수강신청</span></span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#212121\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;라. 조기졸업 신청을 사후신청(7학기 이내)으로 변경</span></span></font></span></span></p><p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></p><p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" cla